{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/853107-who-and-or-what-are-the-dis","id":853107,"title":"Who and/or what are the \"Dis\"","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-03-25T12:18:17-07:00","id":853107,"title":"Who and/or what are the \"Dis\"","content":"I've heard tale of some race called the &quot;Dis&quot; around the area of the dreaming sea, can someone please elaborate on who/what this race is, where they are based out of? or any other lore about them?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2327-bhaalwolfe","name":"Bhaalwolfe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-25T12:41:15-07:00","id":853115,"title":"","content":"I believe that pretty much everything about the Dreaming Sea area is a completely new creation. If it isn't in the book, there's no more information to be had.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1520732-forged-by-purpose-alchemicals-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Forged By Purpose: The Alchemicals</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1413451-dead-but-not-gone-ghosts\" target=\"_blank\">Dead But Not Gone: Ghosts</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/228291-ghosts-a-revision-peach\" target=\"_blank\">Ghosts: A Revision</a> (2nd Edition)<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/316-masters-of-the-industrial-elements-2e-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Masters of the Industrial Elements</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1157362-from-the-crucible-crafting-as-a-struggle-peach\" target=\"_blank\">\u200bFrom The Crucible: Crafting As A Struggle</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/74-kyeudo","name":"Kyeudo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar74_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1723"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-25T12:48:20-07:00","id":853123,"title":"","content":"perhaps it was some home brew stuff,but some people ont he forums here were posting about them, specifically in the homebrew naval stuff for dreaming sea, and based off the context of them, they seemed like evil death tainted, but not undead, giants (20-30 ft tall) beings that leave pain and suffering in their wake. homebrew or cannon, i was hoping someone had some more info on them cause they seemed intriguing like i might want to use them for a campaign im running.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2327-bhaalwolfe","name":"Bhaalwolfe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-25T12:55:05-07:00","id":853131,"title":"","content":"Only reference I am aware of is a world called Dis, described as &quot;...an alien hellhole, tailor made for its prisoner inhabitants...&quot;<br /> <br /> This is from page 90 in the Heaven's Reach chapter of Shards of the Exalted Dream. It should not be considered related at all to 3rd Edition, though I am suddenly curious how many other small references were dreamed up in Shards and then sneaked into 3e.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.t